---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Publications | Md. Farhatul Abrar"
  description="Publications by Md. Farhatul Abrar on life-cycle assessment, hydrothermal carbonization, and waste-to-energy processes."
>
  <main class="page">
    <h1>Publications</h1>

    <section class="pub-group">
      <h2>Published</h2>
      <ol class="pub-list">
        <li>
          Rahman, K. F., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Tithi, S. S., Kabir,
          K. B., &amp; Kirtania, K. (2024).
          <a
            href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jenvman.2024.122850"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Life cycle assessment of hydrothermal carbonization of
            municipal solid waste for waste-to-energy generation</a
          >. <em>Journal of Environmental Management, 370</em>, Article
          122850.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="pub-group">
      <h2>Conference Presentations</h2>
      <ol class="pub-list" start="2">
        <li>
          <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Rana, S., Mimmi, S. F., Saha, C. K.,
          &amp; Kirtania, K. (2023). CFD simulation of a natural convection
          mixed-mode solar dryer using OpenFOAM. Presented at the 7th
          International Conference on Chemical Engineering (ICChE 2023).
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="pub-group">
      <h2>Under Review</h2>
      <ol class="pub-list" start="3">
        <li>
          <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Ahsan, S., Khatun, M. L., Saha, C.
          K., Kabir, K. B., &amp; Kirtania, K. (n.d.). Comparative life cycle
          assessment of hydrothermal carbonization and open dumping of
          anaerobic digestate. Manuscript submitted for publication to <em
            >Bioresource Technology Reports</em
          >.
        </li>
        <li>
          Chambers, C., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Grimes, S., Kirtania,
          K., &amp; Reza, M. T. (n.d.). Techno-economic analysis and
          life-cycle assessment of pyrolyzed hydrochar production from waste
          corn stover. Manuscript submitted for publication to <em
            >Next Sustainability</em
          >.
        </li>
        <li>
          Ahmed, F., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Sonnet, H. M. S., Srabon,
          F. S., Jannat, M., &amp; Kirtania, K. (n.d.). Life cycle assessment
          of phase change material supported on sugarcane bagasse-derived
          biochar for building energy storage. Manuscript submitted for
          publication to <em>Energy Reports</em>.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="pub-group">
      <h2>Manuscripts in Preparation</h2>
      <ol class="pub-list" start="6">
        <li>
          Ahsan, S., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Kabir, K. B., &amp;
          Kirtania, K. (n.d.). Optimization of hydrothermal carbonization
          reaction conditions for nutrient recovery from bio-slurry.
          Manuscript in preparation.
        </li>
        <li>
          Alam, M. S., Prangon, R. D., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, Ahmed,
          F., Kabir, K. B., &amp; Kirtania, K. (n.d.). Framework development
          for biorefinery process repository and superstructure generation
          for LCA metric-based decision making. Manuscript in preparation.
        </li>
        <li>
          Rama, S. S., Hasan, A. M. S., <strong>Abrar, M. F.</strong>, &amp;
          Kirtania, K. (n.d.). Life cycle assessment of PVA–chitosan-based
          hydrogel. Manuscript in preparation.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style>
    .page {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 24px 120px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 40px;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .pub-group {
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-head);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .pub-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.4em;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .pub-list li {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    .pub-list a {
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-decoration-color: var(--border);
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .pub-list a:hover {
      text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>